      "description": "Analyze own source resources already read. Default table_path ['records']. Filters/field accept exact keys or dot paths such as values.Status. rows/count/group_count/sum operate on filtered records. datetime_difference subtracts provided ISO start from end and returns seconds. This service does not retrieve unread resources.",
